. Before him, there were few comedies or tragedies about wooing or wedding. And yet he explored the sacrament in all its aspects, spiritual, psychological, sexual, sociological, and was the creator of some of the most tenacious and intelligent heroines in English literature.","thumbnailUrl":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/5337745-L.jpg","renownProfile":{"knowsBook":true,"publicFame":47,"criticalRenown":42,"controversy":38,"llmAffinity":73,"affinityResidual":-5.73,"confidence":{"publicFame":0.93,"criticalRenown":0.86,"controversy":0.82,"llmAffinity":0.95},"tags":{"craft":"prose-style","evidence":"archival-research","stance":"revisionism"},"model":"gpt-5.6-luna","promptVersion":1},"experimentalSemanticProfile":{"centralFigures":[{"name":"Ann Hathaway","confidence":0.98},{"name":"Shakespeare","confidence":0.78}],"centralPlaces":[],"argument":{"present":true,"statement":"Ann Hathaway’s historical marginalization rests on assumptions rather than evidence, and Shakespeare’s writings on marriage warrant reevaluating her place in history.","confidence":0.9},"academicOrientation":{"score":35,"confidence":0.92},"profileConfidence":0.9,"lowerConfidenceCandidates":{"centralPlaces":[{"name":"England","confidence":0.7}]},"model":"gpt-5.6-luna","promptVersion":8,"inputHash":"fc1f57e14bb81e7b7a3b94a49a54e437ccb3150c1726195a161fac4cb891ee66","reviewStatus":"unreviewed","validationWarnings":[]},"displaySummary":"The omission of her name from Shakespeare’s will has been interpreted as evidence that she was nothing more than an unfortunate mistake from which Shakespeare did well to distance himself. Yet Shakespeare is above all the poet of marriage. Before him, there were few comedies or tragedies about wooing or wedding. And yet he explored the sacrament in all its aspects, spiritual, psychological, sexual, sociological, and was the creator of some of the most tenacious and intelligent heroines in English literature.","primarySubject":"Biography","primaryTopic":"Essays & Cultural